<deviceset name="691401710010B" urn="urn:adsk.eagle:component:16178762/6" prefix="J">
<description>WR-TBL Serie 401B - 5.00 mm Screwless Horizontal Entry - 2.0 mm 2 Wires 

KIND PROPERTIES 

Pitch 5 mm     

MATERIAL PROPERTIES 

Insulator Material PA66 

Insulator Flammability Rating UL94 V-0 

Contact Material Brass 

Contact Plating Tin 

Wire Guard Material Stainless Steel 

GENERAL INFORMATION 

Operating Temperature -40 up to +105 °C 

Compliance RoHS 

ELECTRICAL PROPERTIES 

IR cULus 10 A 

IR VDE 16 A 

Working Voltage [cULus] 300 V (AC) 

Working Voltage [VDE] 450 V (AC) 

Withstanding Voltage [cULus] 2000 V (AC) 

Contact Resistance [cULus] 20 mΩ 

Contact Resistance [VDE] 20 mΩ 

Mechanical Properties

Wire Strip Length 9 up to 10 (mm)  

Wire Properties

Solid Wire Section (AWG) 14 to 24 (AWG) 

Solid Wire Section (Metric) 2.08 to 0.205 (mm²) 

Stranded Wire Section (AWG) 14 to 24 (AWG) 

Stranded Wire Section (Metric) 2.08 to 0.205 (mm²) 

CERTIFICATION 

cULus Approval E315414 

VDE Approval 40036896 

Packaging Properties

Packaging Box 

Details see: www.we-online.com/en/components/products/TBL_5_00_401B_SCREWLESS_HORIZONTAL_ENTRY_2_0MM2_WIRES_6914017100XXB/

Updated by Ella Wu  2019-12-31

2019(C) Würth Elektronik</description>
